{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1746622436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOP TO THE BEAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RiBeat!</strong> is a challenging rhythm-puzzle game where you move to the beat of the music. Hop through a colorful world where every obstacles\u2014spikes, lightning rods, and more\u2014moves in sync with the rhythm.\u00a0Stay in sync\u2014or get struck by the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1746622436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE PUZZLES WITH A MUSICAL TWIST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a test of both rhythm and wits. You'll need to read the obstacles, predict patterns, and time your moves precisely to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1746622436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BATTLE IN MUSICAL SHOWDOWNS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a groovy gang of animal musicians in one-on-one rhythm duels. Each boss has a unique instrument, theme song, and beat-synced attacks that'll keep you dancing\u2014and dodging!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2603750?t=1746622436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2603750?t=1746622436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746622436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746622436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","i